WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.840
Hiring can fall behind,
even when you have plenty of CVs.

00:03.840 --> 00:05.800
Candidates are waiting for feedback,

00:05.800 --> 00:08.720
managers are trying to fit interviews
into busy schedules,

00:08.720 --> 00:12.640
and someone who accepted your offer
still hasn't confirmed their joining date.

00:12.640 --> 00:16.720
Your HR team is chasing all of this
while handling their day job.

00:16.720 --> 00:21.120
That's where Recruitment Process Outsourcing,
or RPO, can help.

00:21.120 --> 00:25.600
With TASC, a dedicated recruitment team
manages the stages we agree with you,

00:25.600 --> 00:28.020
from finding and screening candidates,

00:28.020 --> 00:30.800
to coordinating interviews,
offers and joining.

00:30.800 --> 00:33.040
You keep control of who gets hired.

00:33.040 --> 00:37.280
Together, we track where things are
slowing down and what needs a decision.

00:37.280 --> 00:41.760
That support can cover ongoing recruitment
or a specific hiring project.

00:41.760 --> 00:44.600
Before adding more recruiters
or another agency,

00:44.600 --> 00:46.960
ask, "Where is the work getting stuck?"

00:46.960 --> 00:49.400
Tell us what you need to hire and by when.

00:49.400 --> 00:51.440
We'll work through the right scope with you.
